        "x264: master at r3223 (commit 0480cb05, the head of master and the revision Gyan's 9.0.2 build uses). zlib (win-x64 only, static): needed for compressed QuickTime headers, zlib-compressed Matroska tracks and the PNG, TSCC, ZMBV and Flash Screen Video decoders; macOS uses the system zlib."
